{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"promoted":1,"teasers":40},[2,15,26],{"title":3,"employer":4,"tags":5,"image":9,"alt":3,"released":10,"promoted":11,"slug":12,"content":13,"canonical":14},"Lego Boost","noprotocol",[6,7,8],"vue","video","rxjs","lego-boost.png","",1,"top1","\u003Cp>Verreweg het leukste project ooit. Een campagne site waarbij je zelf blokken in een timeline kon slepen om zodoende de LEGO Boost robot te programmeren.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Een leuke uitdaging met o.a. multi-touch drag-and-drop en video&#39;s die soepel en met geluid in willekeurige volgorde worden afgespeeld.\u003C/p>\n","lego-boost",{"title":16,"employer":17,"tags":18,"image":21,"released":10,"promoted":22,"slug":23,"content":24,"canonical":25},"Smart Clock","open source",[19,20],"golang","sdl2","smart-clock.png",2,"top2","\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/bfanger/clock\">Smart Clock\u003C/a> is een app die ik voor ons gezin heb gemaakt. Deze draait in de woonkamer op een Raspberry Pi met een \u003Ca href=\"https://shop.pimoroni.com/products/hyperpixel-4\">4.0 inch scherm\u003C/a> naast de TV.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Naast dat deze de tijd weergeeft met analoge wijzers, zodat mijn zoontje (en ik) beter leerde klokkijken is de klok door de jaren heen verder uitgebreid met nuttige informatie zoals:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Timer die aftelt voordat school begint, met tijden uit \u003Ca href=\"https://magister.nl/\">Magister\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Welke afvalbak er aan de straat gezet moet worden obv de \u003Ca href=\"https://www.hvcgroep.nl/afval/afvalkalender\">HVC afvalkalender\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Het volume van mijn Sonos Ray soundbar\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Is er het aankomende uur regen voorspeld vanuit \u003Ca href=\"https://www.buienradar.nl/\">Buienradar\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>en meer...\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n","smart-clock",{"title":27,"employer":28,"released":10,"image":29,"alt":27,"tags":30,"promoted":36,"slug":37,"content":38,"canonical":39},"NLZIET","triple","nlziet.png",[31,32,8,33,34,35],"svelte","typescript","smarttv","bitmovin","shaka-player",3,"top3","\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.nlziet.nl/\">NLZIET\u003C/a> is een alternatief voor kabeltelevisie, maar naast live tv kijken biedt deze dienst ook extra features zoals terugkijken of reclamevrij kijken.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Wij hebben voor NLZIET de SmartTV app ontwikkeld, deze maakt gebruik van het Mauna Framework dat we bij Triple ontwikkeld hebben.\u003C/p>\n","nlziet",[41,45,49,53,57,61,65,68,72,76,80,84,88,92,96,100,104,108,112,116,120,124,128,132,134,138,142,145,148,152,156,160,164,168,172,176,180,184,188,190,193,196,200,203,207,211,215,218,222,226,230,234,238,242,246,249,253,257,261,265,266,270,274,278,281,285,288,291,295,299,301,305,309,313,317,321,325,329,333,337,341,343,347,351,355,359,363,367,371,375,379,383,387,391,393,397,401,405,409,412,415,419,423,427,431,435,438,441,444,447,450,453,456,459,462,465,468,472,475,478,481,484,488,491,494,497,500,504,508,512,515,518,522,525,528,531,534,538,542,546,550],{"slug":42,"title":43,"released":44},"slopcorp","SlopCorp","2026-10-05",{"slug":46,"title":47,"released":48},"agent-container","Agent Container","2026-06",{"slug":50,"title":51,"released":52},"poppenkast-3d","Virtuele Poppenkast","2026-03-01",{"slug":54,"title":55,"released":56},"dice-game-update","Dice Game 2.0","2026-02-05",{"slug":58,"title":59,"released":60},"this-nl","Nieuwe huisstijl voor this.nl","2026-01",{"slug":62,"title":63,"released":64},"this-portfolio","Portfolio website van This is Creative","2025-11",{"slug":66,"title":67,"released":64},"store-management-akzonobel","Store Management - AkzoNobel",{"slug":69,"title":70,"released":71},"ecom-checkout-akzonobel","E-commerce Checkout - AkzoNobel","2025-09",{"slug":73,"title":74,"released":75},"dulux-connect","Dulux Connect","2025-04",{"slug":77,"title":78,"released":79},"iot-exchange","IoT Exchange","2025-02",{"slug":81,"title":82,"released":83},"thisisprivate","This is Priva